Preserve HTTP status/body and malformed JSON failures in provider streams.
Streams missing a terminal reason fail explicitly; terminal events retain
providerStopReason. Re-export the adapter SDK finish-reason declaration for
exhaustive service policy. Upstream now owns request cancellation and latest
usage propagation; those obsolete hunks are removed. Runtime regression:
apps/api/src/lib/tanstack-ai-provider-wire.test.ts.

